	"Description": "Without making these 5 characters dramatically different than any other NPC in the game we&#39;ve overhauled the female Marriage Candidates.\r<br />\r<br />We&#39;ve noticed the older portraits were generally more appealing, but lacked the finish and facial details of the new models.\r<br />\r<br />We also noticed that there is no consistency in the new portraits, sometimes they&#39;re facing sideways sometimes straight forward.\r<br />\r<br />So we took the front view approach, and took the appeal of the old portraits but made sure to copy over the defined facial features and better styles of the two.\u00A0",
